# CaloFit — Antigravity AI Assistant Guidelines (.antigravityrules)

# Project Context
- Project: CaloFit (Sağlıklı Kilo Alma & Fit Beslenme Portalı)
- Architecture: HTML5, Vanilla CSS3, ES6+ JavaScript SPA (Single Page Application)
- Storage: Browser LocalStorage (`calofit_app_data_v1`)

# Core Directives for Assistant
1. Preserve existing functional code in `index.html`, `style.css`, and `app.js`. Do not modify working business logic without explicit request.
2. Follow architectural conventions documented in `PROJE_KURALLARI.md`.
3. Keep modular code inside `src/` for future feature extensions.
4. Ensure dark/light mode compatibility for all UI components.
5. Use semantic HTML and HSL/Custom Properties for styling.
